    sizes=&quot;(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 80vw, 900px&quot;
    alt=&quot;Mixed-media painting of a whimsical upright crocodile-like creature with a long toothy snout, white body, and yellow claws, standing on a dark rust-colored ground against a muted pink background.&quot;
